  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 5af86c06a1cd5294e909c2ee75d2c673, type: 3}
  m_Name: Halyna NPCDialogue  Part2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NPCDialogue
  npcName: Halyna
  npcPortrait: {fileID: -6471082416391893753, guid: 53d5f5efd048d2d4081b29c56deb11a6, type: 3}
  dialogueLines:
  - And look what I found. A small box full of odds and ends.
  - It belonged to my husband. Keys, coins, you know how it goes.
  - The only thing that stayed here from the previous family...
  - was a jewelry box. If the key survived, it is probably inside.
  - Take it. Maybe you will find what we need.
  - Every Friday they walked to the market where she worked.
  - Alll dressed up.  Like it was a holiday.
  - "Ah\u2026 that. The old owners had something there."
  - A small little case.
  - My father once tried to sand it away. Said it looked strange.
  - But the mark never disappeared.
  - Well... after all these years...
  - Maybe this was waiting for you all along.
  - Maybe it is time to open it again.
  - I hope you find what you're looking for.
